<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Wallet Fincard — Sitio en mantenimiento</title>
<meta name="description" content="Wallet Fincard está en mantenimiento. Volvemos pronto." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  /* ============ TOKENS — Esquema claro tipo Hallmark "Quiet" ============ */
  :root{
    /* Fondos */
    --bg:#FFFFFF;
    --bg-alt:#F7F7F9;
    --surface:#FFFFFF;
    --surface-soft:#F2F2F7;

    /* Texto */
    --text:#1D1D1F;
    --muted:#6E6E76;
    --muted-soft:#8E8E98;

    /* Acento principal: azul frío */
    --accent:#0A66FF;
    --accent-soft:#E8F0FF;

    /* Acento secundario: coral para el estado */
    --coral:#FF6B6B;
    --coral-soft:#FFF0F0;

    /* Bordes y sombras */
    --border:#E5E5EA;
    --border-soft:#EFEFF4;
    --shadow-soft:0 20px 50px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
    --shadow-card:0 30px 80px -40px rgba(0,0,0,.18);

    --radius:24px;
  }

  /* ============ BASE ============ */
  *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{height:100%}
  body{
    margin:0;
    min-height:100dvh;
    font-family:'Inter',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:clamp(28px,6vw,64px) 20px;
    position:relative;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }

  /* Fondo con un halo azul muy tenue, sin gradientes fuertes */
  body::before{
    content:"";
    position:fixed;
    inset:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    z-index:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 500px at 80% -10%,rgba(10,102,255,.06),transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(700px 400px at 10% 110%,rgba(255,107,107,.04),transparent 60%);
  }

  ::selection{background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent)}

  /* ============ LAYOUT ============ */
  .stage{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    width:100%;
    max-width:560px;
  }

  /* ============ MARCA ============ */
  .brand{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    gap:14px;
    margin-bottom:clamp(26px,4vw,38px);
  }

  .brand__mark{
    width:48px;
    height:48px;
    flex:none;
    border-radius:15px;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    display:grid;
    place-items:center;
    color:var(--accent);
    box-shadow:0 8px 20px -12px rgba(10,102,255,.25);
  }

  .brand__mark svg{
    width:26px;
    height:26px;
  }

  .brand__name{
    font-family:'Sora',system-ui,sans-serif;
    font-size:clamp(1.35rem,2.6vw,1.55rem);
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-.035em;
    line-height:1;
    white-space:nowrap;
    color:var(--text);
  }

  .brand__name span{
    color:var(--accent);
  }

  /* ============ TARJETA DECORATIVA ============ */
  .deco-card{
    position:absolute;
    top:-46px;
    right:-52px;
    width:240px;
    height:150px;
    border-radius:20px;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-card);
    transform:rotate(9deg);
    opacity:.9;
    z-index:0;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:space-between;
    padding:18px 20px;
    pointer-events:none;
  }

  .deco-chip{
    width:32px;
    height:23px;
    border-radius:6px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E8D9B5,#C9A24F);
    opacity:.9;
    box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
  }

  .deco-number{
    font-family:'Sora',monospace;
    font-size:.86rem;
    letter-spacing:.22em;
    color:var(--muted-soft);
  }

  .deco-brand{
    font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;
    font-size:.62rem;
    letter-spacing:.22em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--muted-soft);
  }

  /* ============ PANEL ============ */
  .panel{
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:clamp(34px,6vw,56px);
    text-align:center;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--border);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  /* Línea superior de acento muy fina */
  .panel::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:0;
    left:50%;
    transform:translateX(-50%);
    width:64px;
    height:3px;
    border-radius:0 0 4px 4px;
    background:var(--accent);
    opacity:.85;
  }

  /* ============ ESTADO ============ */
  .status{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:9px;
    padding:7px 15px;
    border-radius:999px;
    background:var(--coral-soft);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,107,107,.28);
    color:var(--coral);
    font-size:.76rem;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.09em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:24px;
  }

  .status__dot{
    width:7px;
    height:7px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--coral);
    flex:none;
    animation:pulse 2.2s ease-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse{
    0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,107,.4)}
    70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(255,107,107,0)}
    100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(255,107,107,0)}
  }

  /* ============ TEXTO ============ */
  h1{
    font-family:'Sora',system-ui,sans-serif;
    font-size:clamp(1.85rem,4.6vw,2.55rem);
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:-.035em;
    line-height:1.14;
    margin:0 0 18px;
    color:var(--text);
  }

  h1 span{
    color:var(--accent);
  }

  .lead{
    margin:0 auto;
    max-width:40ch;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:clamp(.94rem,1.4vw,1.02rem);
  }

  /* ============ META ============ */
  .meta{
    margin-top:32px;
    padding-top:26px;
    border-top:1px solid var(--border-soft);
    display:grid;
    gap:14px;
    text-align:left;
  }

  .meta__row{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:20px;
    font-size:.88rem;
  }

  .meta__label{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:.74rem;
    font-weight:600;
    letter-spacing:.11em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    flex:none;
  }

  .meta__value{
    color:var(--text);
    font-weight:500;
    text-align:right;
    word-break:break-word;
  }

  .meta__value--muted{color:var(--muted)}

  /* ============ PIE ============ */
  .foot{
    margin-top:26px;
    font-size:.76rem;
    color:var(--muted-soft);
    letter-spacing:.02em;
  }

  /* ============ RESPONSIVE ============ */
  @media (max-width:720px){
    .deco-card{display:none}
    .brand{gap:12px}
    .brand__mark{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:14px}
    .brand__mark svg{width:24px;height:24px}
  }

  @media (max-width:440px){
    .meta__row{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:4px}
    .meta__value{text-align:left}
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="stage">

    <!-- Tarjeta decorativa de fondo -->
    <div class="deco-card" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="deco-chip"></span>
      <span class="deco-number">•••• 4287</span>
      <span class="deco-brand">Wallet Fincard</span>
    </div>

    <main class="panel" role="main" aria-labelledby="maintenance-title">

      <!-- Marca -->
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="brand__mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="2.6" y="8.6" width="13.8" height="9.8" rx="2.6" opacity=".35"/>
            <rect x="7.6" y="5.2" width="13.8" height="9.8" rx="2.6"/>
            <path d="M7.6 8.6h13.8"/>
            <path d="M10.8 11.9h3.2"/>
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="brand__name">Wallet <span>Fincard</span></span>
      </div>

      <!-- Estado -->
      <span class="status">
        <span class="status__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Mantenimiento programado
      </span>

      <h1 id="maintenance-title">
        Estamos afinando<br />
        <span>tu cartera digital</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="lead">
        Wallet Fincard se encuentra temporalmente fuera de línea mientras realizamos
        tareas de mantenimiento. Volvemos pronto con una experiencia más rápida y segura.
      </p>

      <div class="meta">
        <div class="meta__row">
          <span class="meta__label">Servicio</span>
          <span class="meta__value">Wallet y tarjetas digitales</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta__row">
          <span class="meta__label">Estado</span>
          <span class="meta__value">En mantenimiento</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta__row">
          <span class="meta__label">Contacto</span>
          <span class="meta__value">soporte@fintec.com.mx</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta__row">
          <span class="meta__label">Regreso</span>
          <span class="meta__value meta__value--muted">Pronto</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="foot">© 2026 Wallet Fincard · Gracias por tu paciencia</p>

    </main>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
